        {
            "title": "A股半日跌   深股創板跌逾2%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A股半日收跌。深股及創業板跌逾2%，滬股跌逾1%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"A股 (AP圖片)\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/05/20250206_FI_source-ap_AShare.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"A股 (AP圖片)\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/05/20250206_FI_source-ap_AShare.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">A股 (AP圖片)</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬綜指收跌56點或1.57%，報3,521，早段見3,534，跌47點或1.31%，最低報3,500，挫2.15%，該水平有支持。半日成交4,039.89億元(人民幣‧下同)。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">深成指收跌217點或2.05%，報10,365，早段見10,436，跌147點或1.38%，為半日高位，後段見10,286，挫297點或2.8%，半日成交4,517.79億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">創業板跌47點或2.08%，報2,245 ; 滬深300跌67點或1.7%，報3,916。</p>\n</div>",
